#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_cash_session_differences.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s cash differences from %(from)s to %(to)s: %(losses)s missing and %(profits)s in surplus."
msgstr "%(count)s diferencias de caja del %(from)s al %(to)s: %(losses)s que faltan y %(profits)s que sobran."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_cash_session_differences.py:0
msgid "Cash session (shift): a statement of a cash journal, opened and closed from the PMS (the legacy API and the FastAPI one work on the same statements). Closing it compares the cash counted with the theoretical balance (opening balance plus the cash payments of the shift)."
msgstr "Sesión de caja (turno): un extracto de un diario de caja, abierto y cerrado desde el PMS (la API antigua y la de FastAPI trabajan sobre los mismos extractos). Al cerrarla se compara el efectivo contado con el saldo teórico (saldo de apertura más los cobros en efectivo del turno)."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_cash_session_differences.py:0
msgid "Difference: the statement line posted to the loss account of the cash journal (negative: cash missing) or to its profit account (positive: surplus) when the counted cash does not match. A difference found when opening a session with a forced base is recorded the same way: concept shows which."
msgstr "Diferencia: la línea de extracto que se registra en la cuenta de pérdidas del diario de caja (negativa: falta efectivo) o en la de beneficios (positiva: sobra) cuando el efectivo contado no cuadra. Una diferencia detectada al abrir una sesión con base forzada se registra igual: el concepto indica cuál es."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_cash_session_differences.py:0
msgid "date: accounting date of the difference line. closed_by: the user who recorded it, which is the user closing the session (or opening it, for a difference found when opening)."
msgstr "date: fecha contable de la línea de diferencia. closed_by: el usuario que la registró, que es quien cierra la sesión (o quien la abre, si la diferencia se detectó al abrir)."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_cash_session_differences.py:0
msgid "Only cash journals of the hotels in scope. The listed differences are the largest in absolute value; the figures by property cover all of them."
msgstr "Solo diarios de caja de los hoteles en alcance. Las diferencias listadas son las mayores en valor absoluto; las cifras por hotel las incluyen todas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_cash_session_differences.py:0
msgid "Sensitive: it names the employees who closed the cash."
msgstr "Sensible: nombra a los empleados que cerraron la caja."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(invoices)s overdue invoices for %(amount)s on %(date)s."
msgstr "%(invoices)s facturas vencidas por %(amount)s a %(date)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
msgid "Overdue invoice: posted customer invoice (credit notes are not counted) with an open amount and a due date before as_of. The amount is what is still open, in the company currency, without netting payments or credit notes of the same customer that were not applied to the invoice."
msgstr "Factura vencida: factura de cliente publicada (no cuentan las rectificativas) con importe pendiente y vencimiento anterior a as_of. El importe es lo que sigue pendiente, en la moneda de la compañía, sin compensar cobros ni rectificativas del mismo cliente que no se hayan aplicado a la factura."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
msgid "Aging: days between the due date and as_of, in the buckets 1_30, 31_60, 61_90 and over_90. An invoice with several due dates is aged by its last one."
msgstr "Antigüedad: días entre el vencimiento y as_of, en los tramos 1_30, 31_60, 61_90 y over_90. Una factura con varios vencimientos se clasifica por el último."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
msgid "Property: the property of the invoice; invoices without property are grouped apart. partner_kind filters by the commercial partner of the invoice: agency (marked as agency), company (a company that is not an agency) or all."
msgstr "Hotel: el hotel de la factura; las facturas sin hotel se agrupan aparte. partner_kind filtra por la empresa comercial de la factura: agency (marcada como agencia), company (empresa que no es agencia) o all."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
msgid "Sensitive: accounting data of customers."
msgstr "Sensible: datos contables de clientes."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "top_debtors: the %s customers with the largest open amount. anonymous_customer marks the shared customer of simplified invoices."
msgstr "top_debtors: los %s clientes con más importe pendiente. anonymous_customer marca el cliente compartido de las facturas simplificadas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_customer_overdue.py:0
msgid "No property"
msgstr "Sin hotel"

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folios_pending_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(folios)s finished folios still to invoice (%(amount)s without taxes) with checkout from %(from)s to %(to)s."
msgstr "%(folios)s folios terminados pendientes de facturar (%(amount)s sin impuestos) con salida del %(from)s al %(to)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folios_pending_invoice.py:0
msgid "Finished folio: normal folio with at least one reservation that is not cancelled and all of them checked out (state Out). Checkout: the latest checkout date of its reservations that are not cancelled."
msgstr "Folio terminado: folio normal con al menos una reserva no cancelada y todas con la salida hecha (estado Out). Salida: la fecha de salida más tardía de sus reservas no canceladas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folios_pending_invoice.py:0
msgid "Still to invoice: the PMS flags the folio as To invoice and its amount to invoice is above 0. amount_to_invoice_untaxed is that PMS amount, without taxes and without down payments, in the folio currency. A folio whose whole amount is already in a draft invoice is not counted."
msgstr "Pendiente de facturar: el PMS marca el folio como «A facturar» y su importe a facturar es mayor que 0. amount_to_invoice_untaxed es ese importe del PMS, sin impuestos y sin anticipos, en la moneda del folio. No cuenta un folio cuyo importe completo ya está en una factura en borrador."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folios_pending_invoice.py:0
msgid "Reason hints, not exclusive: no_customer (the folio has no customer or it is the anonymous one), no_vat (the customer has no tax id), payment_pending (the folio still has an amount to be paid), partial_invoice (some nights or services are already in an invoice, posted or draft). A folio without hints has simply not been invoiced yet."
msgstr "Pistas del motivo, no excluyentes: no_customer (el folio no tiene cliente o es el anónimo), no_vat (el cliente no tiene NIF), payment_pending (el folio aún tiene importe pendiente de cobro), partial_invoice (algunas noches o servicios ya están en una factura, publicada o en borrador). Un folio sin pistas simplemente no se ha facturado todavía."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folios_pending_invoice.py:0
msgid "The listed folios are the ones with the largest amounts; the figures by property cover all of them."
msgstr "Los folios listados son los de mayor importe; las cifras por hotel los incluyen todos."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folios_pending_invoice.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(folios)s folios with an amount to invoice (%(amount)s without taxes) have their last checkout in the period but reservations not checked out in the PMS (for example no-shows or delayed departures), so they are not counted until the hotel closes them."
msgstr "%(folios)s folios con importe a facturar (%(amount)s sin impuestos) tienen su última salida en el periodo, pero reservas sin salida hecha en el PMS (por ejemplo, no-shows o salidas retrasadas), así que no se cuentan hasta que el hotel las cierre."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
msgid "Give the number or the id of the invoice."
msgstr "Indique el número o el id de la factura."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
msgid "No invoice or credit note found for that number."
msgstr "No se ha encontrado ninguna factura ni rectificativa con ese número."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(number)s: %(lines)s lines, total %(total)s, state %(state)s."
msgstr "%(number)s: %(lines)s líneas, total %(total)s, estado %(state)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
msgid "Lines: the product lines of the document, with the untaxed amount, the tax and the total of each one. Section and note lines are not listed."
msgstr "Líneas: las líneas de producto del documento, con la base imponible, el impuesto y el total de cada una. Las líneas de sección y de nota no se listan."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
msgid "reverses: the invoice a credit note was created from. reversed_by: the credit notes created from an invoice."
msgstr "reverses: la factura de la que se creó una rectificativa. reversed_by: las rectificativas creadas a partir de una factura."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
msgid "applied_payments: the reconciliations of the document, dated by the accounting date of the counterpart entry. kind says what was applied: a payment, a bank statement line, a down payment invoice, a credit note or another entry."
msgstr "applied_payments: las conciliaciones del documento, fechadas con la fecha contable del apunte contrapartida. kind indica qué se aplicó: un pago, una línea de extracto bancario, una factura de anticipo, una rectificativa u otro asiento."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
msgid "Sensitive: accounting data."
msgstr "Sensible: datos contables."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_invoice_lines.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Several documents share that number: only %s are shown."
msgstr "Varios documentos comparten ese número: solo se muestran %s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(bills)s vendor bills with %(pending)s pending payment on %(cutoff)s."
msgstr "%(bills)s facturas de proveedor con %(pending)s pendiente de pago a %(cutoff)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
msgid "Pending bill: posted vendor bill (credit notes are not counted) with an accounting date on or before the cutoff and an amount not yet settled on that date."
msgstr "Factura pendiente: factura de proveedor contabilizada (no se cuentan las rectificativas) con fecha contable igual o anterior al corte y un importe aún no saldado en esa fecha."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
msgid "paid_at_cutoff: sum of the reconciliations of the bill whose counterpart entry (payment, bank statement line or credit note) is dated on or before the cutoff, so partial payments count by their own date. pending_at_cutoff: the bill total minus that amount, in the company currency."
msgstr "paid_at_cutoff: suma de las conciliaciones de la factura cuyo apunte contrapartida (pago, línea de extracto bancario o rectificativa) tiene fecha igual o anterior al corte, de modo que los pagos parciales cuentan por su propia fecha. pending_at_cutoff: el total de la factura menos ese importe, en la moneda de la compañía."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
msgid "The state of the bill is the current one: a bill posted or a reconciliation undone after the cutoff is not reconstructed. Property: the property of the bill; bills without property are grouped apart."
msgstr "El estado de la factura es el actual: no se reconstruye una factura contabilizada ni una conciliación deshecha después del corte. Alojamiento: el de la factura; las facturas sin alojamiento se agrupan aparte."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
msgid "drafts: vendor bills still in draft (pending validation) dated up to the cutoff, by company."
msgstr "drafts: facturas de proveedor aún en borrador (pendientes de validar) con fecha hasta el corte, por compañía."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
msgid "Sensitive: accounting data of suppliers."
msgstr "Sensible: datos contables de proveedores."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Only the oldest %s candidate bills were analysed."
msgstr "Solo se han analizado las %s facturas candidatas más antiguas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_bills_pending.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Only the %(shown)s suppliers with the most pending are listed."
msgstr "Solo se listan los %(shown)s proveedores con más pendiente."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "Account prefixes must be alphanumeric."
msgstr "Los prefijos de cuenta deben ser alfanuméricos."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(bills)s posted vendor bills from %(from)s to %(to)s, %(untaxed)s untaxed in the analysed lines."
msgstr "%(bills)s facturas de proveedor contabilizadas del %(from)s al %(to)s, %(untaxed)s de base en las líneas analizadas."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "Bills: posted vendor bills (credit notes are not included) with an accounting date in the period, of the properties in scope; bills without property are included. When account prefixes are given, only the lines on those accounts are analysed, but the bill totals are the whole bill."
msgstr "Facturas: facturas de proveedor contabilizadas (sin rectificativas) con fecha contable en el periodo, de los alojamientos accesibles; se incluyen las facturas sin alojamiento. Si se indican prefijos de cuenta, solo se analizan las líneas de esas cuentas, pero los totales de factura son los de la factura completa."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "Lines: the product lines of the bills, with untaxed amount and tax, grouped by supplier, account, month or property."
msgstr "Líneas: las líneas de producto de las facturas, con base e impuesto, agrupadas por proveedor, cuenta, mes o alojamiento."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "Payments: the reconciliations of the bill, dated by the accounting date of the payment. The real method is the payment method and journal type of the payment. When the bill was reconciled directly with a bank statement line there is no payment record: only the journal type is known and the method is reported as not identified."
msgstr "Pagos: las conciliaciones de la factura, fechadas con la fecha contable del pago. El método real es el método de pago y el tipo de diario del pago. Si la factura se concilió directamente con una línea de extracto bancario no hay registro de pago: solo se conoce el tipo de diario y el método se indica como no identificado."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "real_days: days from the bill date to the payment date, weighted by the amount of each payment. late_pct: share of the paid amount settled after the due date. delay_days of a payment: its date minus the due date (negative: early). Credit notes applied to a bill are shown apart and are not payments. Account of a bill in the payment analysis: the account of its largest analysed line."
msgstr "real_days: días desde la fecha de la factura hasta la del pago, ponderados por el importe de cada pago. late_pct: parte del importe pagado después del vencimiento. delay_days de un pago: su fecha menos el vencimiento (negativo: anticipado). Las rectificativas aplicadas a una factura se muestran aparte y no son pagos. Cuenta de una factura en el análisis de pagos: la de su línea analizada más grande."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "paid and pending are as of today, not at the end of the period. Attachments (PDF) are not read."
msgstr "Pagado y pendiente son a día de hoy, no al final del periodo. No se leen los adjuntos (PDF)."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "No account"
msgstr "Sin cuenta"

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Only the first %s bills of the period were analysed."
msgstr "Solo se han analizado las primeras %s facturas del periodo."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_supplier_invoices.py:0
msgid "Not paid"
msgstr "Sin pagar"

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_purchase_bill_mismatch.py:0
msgid "The purchase module is not installed."
msgstr "El módulo de compras no está instalado."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_purchase_bill_mismatch.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(count)s purchase orders differ from their vendor bills by more than %(limit)s from %(from)s to %(to)s (net %(net)s)."
msgstr "%(count)s pedidos de compra difieren de sus facturas de proveedor en más de %(limit)s del %(from)s al %(to)s (neto %(net)s)."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_purchase_bill_mismatch.py:0
msgid "Compared: purchase orders (confirmed) that have a posted vendor bill dated in the period. billed_total: the posted vendor bills of the order (credit notes subtract), in the order currency, including bills outside the period. difference: billed_total minus order_total."
msgstr "Comparados: pedidos de compra (confirmados) con alguna factura de proveedor contabilizada fechada en el periodo. billed_total: las facturas de proveedor contabilizadas del pedido (las rectificativas restan), en la moneda del pedido, incluidas las de fuera del periodo. difference: billed_total menos order_total."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_purchase_bill_mismatch.py:0
msgid "By default only the orders Odoo considers fully billed are compared, because a partly billed order differs from its bills on purpose. A bill shared by several orders counts through its lines linked to each order (shared_bills)."
msgstr "Por defecto solo se comparan los pedidos que Odoo considera totalmente facturados, porque un pedido facturado en parte difiere de sus facturas a propósito. Una factura compartida por varios pedidos cuenta a través de sus líneas vinculadas a cada pedido (shared_bills)."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_purchase_bill_mismatch.py:0
msgid "Property: the property of the bills in the period. bills_by_state: vendor bills in draft (pending validation) and posted bills not yet paid or partly paid, up to the end of the period, by company."
msgstr "Alojamiento: el de las facturas del periodo. bills_by_state: facturas de proveedor en borrador (pendientes de validar) y contabilizadas aún sin pagar o pagadas en parte, hasta el final del periodo, por compañía."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
msgid "The point of sale module is not installed."
msgstr "El módulo de punto de venta no está instalado."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
msgid "This tool needs accounting access."
msgstr "Esta herramienta necesita acceso a contabilidad."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "%(sessions)s POS sessions from %(from)s to %(to)s: sales %(sales)s, closing differences %(difference)s, %(unposted)s closed without a posted entry."
msgstr "%(sessions)s sesiones de TPV del %(from)s al %(to)s: ventas %(sales)s, diferencias de cierre %(difference)s, %(unposted)s cerradas sin asiento contabilizado."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
msgid "Sessions: point of sale sessions opened in the period. The point of sale has no property: it is taken from its cash journal or, failing that, sales journal; sessions whose journals have no property are listed without one."
msgstr "Sesiones: sesiones de punto de venta abiertas en el periodo. El punto de venta no tiene hotel propio: se toma de su diario de caja o, si no, de ventas; las sesiones cuyos diarios no tienen hotel se listan sin él."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
msgid "closing_difference: counted cash minus expected cash of a closed session (negative: cash missing). The employee is the user responsible for the session."
msgstr "closing_difference: efectivo contado menos efectivo esperado de una sesión cerrada (negativo: falta efectivo). El empleado es el usuario responsable de la sesión."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
msgid "sales: paid, posted or invoiced orders (refunds are negative orders and are also shown apart). Cancelled orders are counted apart."
msgstr "sales: pedidos pagados, contabilizados o facturados (los reembolsos son pedidos negativos y se muestran también aparte). Los pedidos cancelados se cuentan aparte."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_pos_cash_audit.py:0
