msgstr "Crear y validar %(count)s factura(s) del folio %(folio)s por un total de %(total)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folio_billing.py:0
#, python-format
