msgstr "Mover el pago %(payment)s de %(amount)s del folio %(source)s al folio %(target)s."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folio_billing_payment.py:0
msgid "The folio of the payment is changed as in the payment form: the payment, its accounting entry and the pending amounts of both folios follow. Only posted customer payments of a single folio that are not reconciled can be moved."
msgstr "Se cambia el folio del pago como en el formulario del pago: el pago, su asiento contable y los importes pendientes de ambos folios se actualizan. Solo se pueden mover pagos de cliente validados, de un único folio y sin conciliar."

#. module: pms_ai_tool_admin
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pms_ai_tool_admin/models/pms_folio_billing_payment.py:0
